  "Pick a friendly **^^Daughters of Khaine^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the target.": "",
  "Pick a friendly **^^Daughters of Khaine^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the target.": "",
  "Pick an enemy **^^Infantry^^** or **^^Cavalry^^** unit in combat with this unit to be the target.": "Elige como objetivo una unidad enemiga **^^Infantry^^** o **^^Cavalry^^** en combate con esta unidad.",
  "This **^^Manifestation^^** is affected by the 'Blessings of Khaine' ability as if it were a unit.": "",
  "Subtract 1 from hit rolls and wound rolls for the target's combat attacks for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of its **Heartrender** is 5.": "",
  "Pick each friendly **^^Daughters of Khaine^^** unit within this unit's combat range to be the targets.": "",
  "**^^War Machine Priest^^** only. Add the **Torrent of Burning Blood** ability to your hero's warscroll.": "",
  "If this **^^Manifestation^^** charged this turn, pick an enemy unit in combat with it to be the target.": "",
  "If this unit has not been deployed, set up this unit in reserve **in hiding**. It has now been deployed.": "",
  "**^^Exalted^^** abilities have no effect on this unit and this unit cannot use **^^Exalted^^** abilities.": "",
  "Pick a visible friendly **^^Daughters of Khaine^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the target.": "Elige como objetivo una unidad amiga **^^Daughters of Khaine^^** visible que esté totalmente a 12\" o menos de esta unidad.",
  "Pick a visible friendly **^^Daughters of Khaine^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the target.": "Elige como objetivo una unidad amiga **^^Daughters of Khaine^^** visible que esté totalmente a 12\" o menos de esta unidad.",
  "Pick a visible friendly **^^Daughters of Khaine^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the target.": "Elige como objetivo una unidad amiga **^^Daughters of Khaine^^** visible que esté totalmente a 12\" o menos de esta unidad.",
  "Pick an enemy **^^Hero^^** or **^^Monster^^** in combat with this **^^Manifestation^^** to be the target.": "",
  "Pick a friendly **^^Daughters of Khaine Manifestation^^** wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the target.": "",
  "Pick a friendly non-**^^Hero Daughters of Khaine Infantry^^** unit in this unit's regiment to be the target.": "",
  "**The following universal terrain abilities apply to this terrain feature (Terrain, 1.2):\r\nCover, Impassable**": "**Las siguientes habilidades universales de escenografía se aplican a este elemento de escenografía (Terrain, 1.2):\nCover, Impassable**",
  "Remove this unit from the battlefield and set it up again on the battlefield more than 9\" from all enemy units.": "Retira esta unidad del campo de batalla y vuelve a colocarla en el campo de batalla a más de 9\" de todas las unidades enemigas.",
  "Remove this unit from the battlefield and set it up again on the battlefield more than 9\" from all enemy units.": "Retira esta unidad del campo de batalla y vuelve a colocarla en el campo de batalla a más de 9\" de todas las unidades enemigas.",
  "Set up a replacement unit identical to the target within 3\" of a friendly **Morathi-Khaine** or **Shadow Queen**.": "",
  "Pick a visible friendly **^^Daughters of Khaine Infantry^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the target.": "",
  "Pick a visible friendly non-**^^Hero Daughters of Khaine^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the target.": "",
  "If the unmodified hit roll for an attack that targets this unit is 1-4, the attack fails and the attack sequence ends.": "Si la tirada de impacto sin modificar de un ataque que tenga como objetivo esta unidad es 1-4, el ataque falla y la secuencia de ataque termina.",
  "Set up an **Avatar of Khaine** wholly within 12\" of the caster, visible to them and more than 9\" from all enemy units.": "",
  "Add 1 to casting rolls for this unit when it uses a **^^Summon^^** ability and add 1 to banishment rolls for this unit.": "",
  "Until the start of your next turn, enemy units and enemy **^^Manifestations^^** cannot be set up within 12\" of this unit.": "",
  "Add 1 to save rolls for friendly **^^Daughters of Khaine Infantry^^** units while they are wholly within 12\" of this unit.": "",
  "Pick this unit if it is in hiding. Then, pick a friendly **^^Infantry^^** unit that has 5 or more models to be the target.": "",
  "The Rend characteristic of this unit's melee weapons is equal to the current battle round number, unless it would be higher.": "",
  "Pick a visible friendly **^^Daughters of Khaine Priest^^** or **^^Wizard^^** wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the target.": "Elige como objetivo un **^^Daughters of Khaine Priest^^** o **^^Wizard^^** amigo visible que esté totalmente a 12\" o menos de esta unidad.",
  "Roll a dice. On a 3+:\r\n• Add 1 to charge rolls for the target.\r\n• Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the target's weapons.": "",
  "Pick a friendly **^^Daughters of Khaine^^** **^^Wizard^^** or **^^Priest^^** within 3\" of this terrain feature to be the target.": "",
  "This unit's combat attacks score critical hits on unmodified hit rolls of 4+ if the target of those attacks has **^^Strike-Last^^**.": "",
  "After that **^^Shoot^^** ability has been resolved, this unit can move 2D6\". It cannot move into combat during any part of that move.": "",
  "Pick a friendly non-**^^Unique Daughters of Khaine Aelf Infantry^^** or **^^Cavalry^^** unit that has been destroyed to be the target.": "",
  "Roll a dice. If the roll is less than the number of damage points the target has, inflict an amount of mortal damage equal to the roll.": "",
  "If an enemy unit was destroyed by this unit's combat attacks this turn, when resolving that ability, you can pick 2 blessings instead of 1.": "",
  "When this unit uses the 'Redeploy' command, if you roll a 1-3 when determining the distance this unit can move, you can use a value of 4 instead.": "",
  "Roll a dice. If the roll is equal to or less than the target's Health characteristic, the target has **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "While this unit is within 3\" of any visible damaged units (friendly or enemy), add 1 to wound rolls for attacks made with this unit's melee weapons.": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 3+, the target cannot be picked to be the target of **^^Banish^^** abilities used by enemy units until the start of your next turn.": "",
  "Roll a D3. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll and the target has **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "For the rest of the battle, each time the target uses the 'All-out Attack command while it is wholly within 12\" of this unit, no command points are spent.": "",
  "Change your hero's Move characteristic to 12\".\r\nYour hero has the **^^Fly^^** keyword and the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Daughters of Khaine^^** units": "",
  "Your hero has the 'Peerless Agility' ability and the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Daughters of Khaine^^** units\r\nYour hero has the **^^Aelf^^** keyword.": "",
  "Remove this unit from the battlefield and set it up again more than **X**\" from all enemy units, where **X** is equal to 10 minus the current battle round number.": "",
  "Your hero gains the **^^Priest (1)^^** keyword and the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Daughters of Khaine^^** units\r\nYour hero has the **^^Aelf^^** keyword.": "",
  "If there are fewer friendly **Avatars of Khaine** on the battlefield than there are friendly **Bloodwrack Shrines** on the battlefield, make a casting roll of 2D6.": "",
  "If any enemy units are **constricted**, they are no longer **constricted**. Pick an enemy **^^Hero^^** or **^^Monster^^** in combat with this unit to be the target.": "",
  "Roll a D3. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll and the target cannot use **^^Rampage^^** abilities for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "Subtract 1 from wound rolls for attacks that target friendly **^^Daughters of Khaine Infantry^^** units while they are wholly within 12\" of this **^^Manifestation^^**.": "",
  "Set up a replacement unit with half the number of models from the target unit (rounding up) wholly within 9\" of a battlefield edge and more than 9\" from all enemy units.": "",
  "If this unit is not in combat, pick a visible enemy **^^Infantry^^** or **^^Cavalry Hero^^** that has no more than 1 model and is within 12\" of this unit to be the target.": "",
  "Pick a visible friendly **^^Daughters of Khaine Aelf Infantry^^** or **^^Cavalry^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the target. Then, make a chanting roll of D6.": "",
  "If this unit is in combat, pick an enemy unit in combat with it to be the target. If this unit is not in combat, pick a visible enemy unit within 12\" of it to be the target.": "",
  "If any damage points are allocated to the target this phase by this **^^Manifestation^^**'s combat attacks, ward rolls cannot be made for the target for the rest of the battle.": "",
  "If this unit is in combat, roll a dice. On a 3+, this unit can immediately use the 'Retreat' ability as if it were your movement phase without any mortal damage being inflicted on it.": "Si esta unidad está en combate, tira un dado. Con un 3+, esta unidad puede usar de inmediato la habilidad 'Retreat' como si fuera tu fase de movimiento, sin que se le inflija ningún daño mortal.",
  "Add X to the Attacks characteristic of this **^^Manifestation^^**'s melee weapons, where X is the number of times you have used the 'Blessings of Khaine' ability this battle, to a maximum of 3.": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 3+, roll a number of dice equal to the target's Health characteristic. Subtract 1 from each roll if the target is a **^^Monster^^**. For each 5+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target.": "",
  "If the target is a friendly **Shadow Queen**, it can immediately use a **^^Fight^^** ability as if it were your combat phase. Otherwise, inflict D3 mortal damage on each enemy unit in combat with the target.": "",
  "Roll a dice. If the roll is equal to or less than that enemy unit's Health characteristic, for the rest of the phase, you can re-roll failed hit rolls for attacks made by this unit that target that enemy unit.": "",
  "While this unit is wholly within 12\" of a friendly **Hag Queen on Cauldron of Blood**, **Slaughter Queen on Cauldron of Blood** or **Shrine of Dark Tribute**, this unit's melee weapons have **^^Anti-charge (+1 Rend)^^**.": "",
  "Roll a dice. If this unit is in combat, you can re-roll the dice. If the roll is lower than your **fury level**, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of weapons used by this unit and the target until the start of your next turn.": "",
  "Shooting attacks that target this unit cannot score critical hits (treat them as regular hits instead). If the unmodified hit roll for a shooting attack that targets this unit is 6, the attack fails and the attack sequence ends.": "",
  "If this unit is in combat, roll a dice. On a 3+, for the rest of the turn:\r\n• Add the roll to the Attacks characteristic of this unit's **Companion** weapons.\r\n• Add 1 to the Rend characteristic of this unit's **Companion** weapons.": "",
  "Roll a D3. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll. Then, if any enemy models were slain by that mortal damage, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to its Health characteristic.": "",
  "This unit can use this ability even if it has been destroyed. If you have used the 'Blessings of Khaine' ability 3 or more times this battle, pick a friendly **Morathi-Khaine** or **Shadow Queen** that has been destroyed to be the target.": "",
  "Change your hero's Health characteristic to 6, their Move characteristic to 8\" and their Save characteristic to 5+.\r\nYour hero has the 'Fist of the Scáthborn' ability and the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Daughters of Khaine^^** units": "",
  "Pick either a friendly **Shadow Queen** wholly within 12\" of this unit and in combat or a visible friendly non-**^^Hero Daughters of Khaine^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit and in combat to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 3+, until the start of your next turn, the target is **constricted** while it is in combat with this unit.\r\nThis unit's combat attacks that target a **constricted** enemy unit score critical hits on unmodified hit rolls of 5+.": "",
  "If the target is more than 3\" from all other friendly units, apply the effect below. Otherwise, roll a dice. On a 3+, apply the effect below. \r\nYour opponent must remove the target from the battlefield and set it up again in combat with this unit.": "",
  "For the rest of the phase, each time a model in a target unit is slain by a combat attack, roll a dice. If that unit is a **Blood Sisters** or **Blood Stalkers** unit, roll 2 dice instead. For each 5+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the attacking unit.": "",
  "If this unit is in combat, add 1 to the Rend characteristic of the target's melee weapons for the rest of the turn. If this unit is not in combat, roll a dice. On a 3+, add 1 to the Rend characteristic of the target's melee weapons for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "Change your hero's Health characteristic to 6, their Move characteristic to 8\" and their Save characteristic to 5+.\r\nYour hero has the **^^Wizard (1)^^** keyword, the 'Bloodwrack Stare' ability and the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Daughters of Khaine^^** units": "",
  "For the rest of the turn, while this unit is in combat with the target, its combat attacks must target that enemy unit. In addition, if any of this unit's attacks score a critical hit on the target this phase, the target has **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "Until the start of your next turn:\r\n• Enemy **^^Manifestations^^** cannot be set up within 12\" of this unit.\r\n• This unit has **^^Ward (4+)^^** against mortal damage inflicted by **^^Spell^^** abilities, **^^Prayer^^** abilities and abilities used by **^^Manifestations^^**.": "",
  "Pick a blessing from the 'Blessings of Khaine' ability that is active. That blessing is no longer active. Then, pick a blessing that is not active. That blessing is now active.\r\n\r\n\r\nDesigner's Note: When you use this ability, you are not using the 'Blessings of Khaine' ability.": "",
  "The target is in dark communion until this terrain feature uses this ability again or until this terrain feature is removed from the battlefield, whichever comes first. While the target is in dark communion, you can re-roll 1 casting roll or 1 chanting roll for the target each turn.": "",
  "If this unit is in combat, it can move 12\". It can pass through the combat ranges of enemy units but cannot end that move in combat. Then, roll a D3 for each enemy unit that this unit passed across during that move. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on that enemy unit equal to the roll.": "",
  "After that **^^Shoot^^** ability has been resolved, if all of this unit's attacks made as part of that **^^Shoot^^** ability targeted the same enemy unit and any enemy models were slain by those attacks, roll a dice. On a 3+, that enemy unit has a maximum control score of 1 for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 4+, if you picked a **Heart of Fury**, set it up wholly within 18\" of this unit and visible to it. Otherwise, on a 4+, set up the **^^Manifestation^^** wholly within 12\" of this unit, visible to it and more than 9\" from all enemy units. This unit has summoned that **^^Manifestation^^**.": "",
  "Each time a friendy **^^Daughters of Khaine^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit uses the 'Rally' command, you can make 3 additional rally rolls of D6. In addition, if there are any friendly **Hag Queens on Cauldrons of Blood** on the battlefield when that command is used, you receive D3 additional rally points.": "",
  "Pick a visible friendly **^^Daughters of Khaine^^** unit that is wholly within 12\" of this unit and is in combat with an enemy unit that charged this turn to be the target. If there are any friendly **Slaughter Queens on Cauldrons of Blood** on the battlefield, you can pick another eligible unit to be a second target.": "",
  "Roll 6 dice:\r\n• For each 1, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of this unit's melee weapons until the start of your next turn.\r\n• For each 3, add 1\" to this unit's Move characteristic until the start of your next turn.\r\n• If any of the rolls are a 6, add 1 to save rolls for this unit until the start of your next turn.": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 3+, set up this unit anywhere on the battlefield wholly within 6\" of the target. If you do so, this unit must be set up in combat and has **^^Strike-first^^** for the rest of the turn. On a failed roll, this unit remains in hiding but you automatically pass the roll the next time you use this ability.": "",
  "For the rest of the turn, each time a visible friendly **^^Daughters of Khaine^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit uses a **Fight** ability, after that ability has been resolved, you can pick a visible friendly **^^Daughters of Khaine Priest^^** wholly within 12\" of this unit. That **^^Priest^^** gains 1 ritual point.": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 3+, pick a blessing from the 'Blessings of Khaine' ability that is not **active**. The effect of that blessing applies to the target until the start of your next turn as if it were **active**. If you have used the 'Blessings of Khaine' ability 3 or more times this battle, you can pick 2 blessings instead of 1.": "",
  "**Champion of the Arena** or **Priestess of Khaine** only. Add the **Dark Steed's Hooves and Teeth** weapon to your hero's warscroll. \r\nIn addition, make the following changes to your hero's warscroll:\r\n• Change the Move characteristic to 14\".\r\n• Change the Health characteristic to 7.\r\n• Replace the **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the **^^Cavalry^^** keyword.": "",
  "If you have used the 'Blessings of Khaine' ability 3 or more times this battle, the target's combat attacks score critical hits on unmodified hit rolls of 4+ for the rest of the turn. Otherwise, roll a dice. If the roll is equal to or less than the current battle round number, the target's combat attacks score critical hits on unmodified hit rolls of 4+ for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "**Champion of the Arena** or **Priestess of Khaine** only.  Add the **Guardians' Blades** and **Avatar's Sword** weapons to your hero's warscroll. \r\nIn addition, make the following changes to your hero's warscroll:\r\n• Change the Health characteristic to 12.\r\n• Change the Save characteristic to 4+.\r\n• Change the Control characteristic to 5.\r\n• Replace the **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the **^^War Machine^^** keyword.": "",
  "After that **^^Shoot^^** ability has been resolved, if all of this unit's attacks targeted the same enemy unit, roll a dice. Add 1 to the roll if any other friendly **Blood Stalkers** units picked that enemy unit to be the target of all of their shooting attacks this turn. On a 3+, until the start of your next turn, subtract 1 from the number of dice rolled when making charge rolls for the target, to a minimum of 1.": "",
  "**Bloodwrack Sorceress** only. Add the **Bloodwrack Stare** and **Guardians' Blades** weapons and the 'Invoke Murder' ability to your hero's warscroll. \r\nIn addition, make the following changes to your hero's warscroll:\r\n• Change the Health characteristic to 12.\r\n• Change the Save characteristic to 4+.\r\n• Change the Control characteristic to 5.\r\n• Replace the **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the **^^War Machine^^** keyword.": "",
  "Pick 1 of the following effects to apply until the start of your next turn:\r\n***Prophecy of Tyranny:*** Enemy units cannot use commands while they are in combat with the target.\r\n***Prophecy of Shelter:*** Other than the **Companion** ability, weapon abilities used by enemy units while they are in combat with the target have no effect.\r\n***Prophecy of Retribution:*** Subtract 1 from ward rolls made for damage points inflicted by the target's combat attacks.\r\nIf the chanting roll was 9+, all of the above effects apply": "",
  "Each time you perform a blood rite, immediately after the ability that destroyed a unit has been resolved, give this unit 1 **prophecy token**.\r\n• While this unit has 2 or more **prophecy tokens**, this unit cannot be picked to be the target of shooting attacks or **^^Spell^^** abilities used by enemy units.\r\n• While this unit has 3 or more **prophecy tokens**, you can re-roll unmodified chanting rolls of 1 for this unit.\r\n• While this unit has 4 or more **prophecy tokens**, if the unmodified hit roll for an attack that targets this unit is 1-4, the attack fails and the attack sequence ends.": "",
  "Roll 5 dice. Add 2 to each roll if the target is **constricted**. For each 5+, pick 1 of the following effects. You cannot pick the same effect more than once per turn.\r\n• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for the target's combat attacks for the rest of the turn.\r\n• Subtract 1 from wound rolls for the target's combat attacks for the rest of the turn.\r\n• Random characteristic rolls for. the Damage characteristic of the target's melee weapons are treated as unmodified rolls of 1 for the rest of the turn.\r\n• Inflict D3 mortal damage on the target.\r\n• The target cannot be healed or have slain models returned to it for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "Pick 1 of the following effects. If the chanting roll was 10+, pick up to 2 different effects instead.\r\n**Prophecy of Exile**: Pick a visible enemy **^^Wizard^^** or **^^Priest^^** within 18\" of this unit. Subtract 1 from that unit's power level until the start of your next turn.\r\n**Prophecy of Dark Wings**: Pick a visible friendly **^^Daughters of Khaine Infantry^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit. That unit can immediately use the 'Normal Move' ability as if it were your movement phase and counts as having used a **^^Run^^** ability this turn.\r\n**Prophecy of Futile Endeavours**: Pick a visible enemy unit within 12\" of this unit. Until the start of your next turn, that unit's attacks cannot score critical hits (treat them as regular hits instead).": "",
  "Each time you perform a blood rite, immediately after the ability that destroyed a unit has been resolved, pick 1 of the following effects:\r\n• Until the start of your next turn, this unit is only visible to enemy units while those units are within its combat range.\r\n• **Heal (D6)** this unit or a friendly **Shadow Queen**.\r\n• A friendly **Shadow Queen** can immediately use the 'Normal Move' or 'Retreat' ability as if it was your movement phase even if it has already used that ability or another **^^Core^^** ability this phase.\r\n**Designer's Note:** *If the Shadow Queen retreats with the 'Iron Heart of Khaine' ability, she cannot subsequently use the 'Fight' ability in the same combat phase.*\r\n• Remove this unit from the battlefield and set it up again on the battlefield more than 9\" from all enemy units.\r\n• For the rest of the turn, set this unit's Control characteristic to 5 and a friendly **Shadow Queen**'s Control characteristic to 15.": ""
}
